          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri izooba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu naabaragiira kworoberar ebiragiro ebi ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe; n'ahabw'ekyo muryaguma muteho omutima kubyorobera n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.48.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 48:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eri izooba mwagamba nimuhamya ku MUKAMA ari Ruhanga waanyu, kandi ku murikwija kugyendera omu mihanda ye, n'okukwata ebiragiro bye n'ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, kandi n'okuhurira eiraka rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
